  <header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">BEHIND THE SYSTEMS</p><h1>Hi, I’m Ghadi<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h1><p>Software engineer. Systems thinker. Builder.</p></header>
  <div class="about-layout"><div class="prose"><p class="about-lead">I’m a software engineer focused on site reliability engineering and infrastructure.</p><p>I’m interested in the whole path from writing software to running it: the code, the delivery workflow, and the systems that support it.</p><p>This site is a place to share that work and the thinking behind it. You’ll find projects, architecture decisions, and field notes as they take shape.</p><p>My <a href="/projects/homelab/">homelab</a> brings those interests together in a k3s cluster managed through GitOps. It’s also where this corner of the internet lives.</p><a class="text-link" href={siteConfig.github}>Find me on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="about-margin"><InfrastructureSketch /><p class="eyebrow">SOFTWARE + SYSTEMS + CURIOSITY</p></div></div>
